#. お、苗木っちと十神っちが
#. 一緒に来たべ！
msgctxt "0001 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Whoa, Byakuya and Makoto showed up together!"
msgstr ""

#. ２人してどこ行ってたの？
#. 急にいなくなって、全然戻って来ないしさぁ…
msgctxt "0002 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Where the heck have you two been!? You just\n"
"disappeared without a word!"
msgstr ""

#. …調べ物に決まってるだろう。
#. いちいち聞くな。
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"We were investigating, of course. How could you not\n"
"figure that out by this point?"
msgstr ""

#. な、苗木の分際で…白夜様と２人っきりで…
#. し、調べ物…？
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"M-Makoto's ranked high enough for you guys to go\n"
"off t-together...just the two of y-you...?"
msgstr ""

#. 嫉妬…？
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What, are you jealous?"
msgstr ""

#. 気色悪い想像してんじゃねーだろな…
msgctxt "0006 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Or...are you making up some kind of creepy fantasy for\n"
"yourself?"
msgstr ""

#. …雑談をやめて気を引き締めろ。
#. そろそろ来るはずだぞ…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Stop talking and brace yourselves. He'll be here any\n"
"second."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そろそろ来る…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Any second...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あいつが来る…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>He could show up at any time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これから起こる事を想像し、
#. ボクは思わず身構えた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When I imagined what was about to happen, I\n"
"immediately tensed up and prepared myself.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>妙な事に、５分待っても…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We stood there for five full minutes, waiting for\n"
"something weird to happen.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>１０分待っても……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And then five minutes became ten...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …どういう事だ？
#. なぜ、モノクマは来ない…
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"What's going on here? Why hasn't Monokuma shown up\n"
"yet?"
msgstr ""

#. また、止まってるんじゃねーか？
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Maybe he died again...?"
msgstr ""

#. どうする？　もう少し待ってみる？
#. それとも…
msgctxt "0016 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "What should we do? Should we keep waiting here, or...?"
msgstr ""

#. …それともッ！？
msgctxt "0017 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Or what!?"
msgstr ""

#. うおッ！　いきなり来た！
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Jesus!"
msgstr ""

#. にょほほ…驚いてやんの…
msgctxt "0019 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Nyohoho! Did I scare you?"
msgstr ""

#. …おい、説明してもらおうか。
#. 俺を待たせるとは、どういうつもりだ？
msgctxt "0020 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I demand an explanation! Why did you waste my time and\n"
"make me wait like that!?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクが？　オマエラを待たせた？
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "What? I made you wait?"
msgstr ""

#. 逆じゃない？　
#. オマエラがボクを待たせてるんじゃん。
msgctxt "0022 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You've got it all backwards. *You're* the ones making\n"
"*me* wait!"
msgstr ""

#. …は？
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. ボクは、オマエラが揃うのを待ってただけだよ。
#. 全員揃わないと始められないでしょ？
msgctxt "0024 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I'm waiting for everyone to arrive! We can't start\n"
"till everyone's here, now can we?"
msgstr ""

#. な、何言ってるのよ…
#. あたし達なら…とっくに揃ってるじゃない…
msgctxt "0025 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"What are you t-talking about...? Everyone *is* here.\n"
"We've all been w-waiting for *you*."
msgstr ""

#. …うぷぷ、揃ってないじゃん。
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... Sorry, but you're wrong."
msgstr ""

#. だけど１０分も待ったんだし、もういいよね？
#. 来ないヤツは校則違反って事でオッケーだよね？
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But I've been waiting ten minutes now, so it's okay if\n"
"I punish the one making us all wait, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そうと決まれば、さっそく処罰の手配を…
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If we all agree it's a violation, I'll arrange a\n"
"punishment right now—!"
msgstr ""

#. …私ならいるわよ。
msgctxt "0029 | NO NAME"
msgid "If it's me you're waiting for...I'm here."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>その声に…一斉に全員が振り返った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When we heard that voice, we all spun around to look.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちゃんと…来てるわよ…
msgctxt "0031 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm here, and no rule's been broken."
msgstr ""

#. き、霧切さん…！！
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "K-Kyoko!"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切ちゃん！　生きてたの！？
msgctxt "0033 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Kyoko!? You're still alive!?"
msgstr ""

#. ち、違う…ありゃ幽霊だべ…
msgctxt "0034 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "N-No...! That's a gh-gh-gh-ghost!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あんたは黙ってていいわよ…
msgctxt "0035 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Stop t-talking..."
msgstr ""

#. はいはい、そこから先は学級裁判でね！
#. ほら、楽しみは後に取って置かないと！
msgctxt "0036 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"If you wanna fight, do it at the class trial! You need\n"
"to save some of the fun for later, right?"
msgstr ""

#. 遅刻のペナルティーは…特になしでいいのか？
msgctxt "0037 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But is it okay that there's no particular penalty for\n"
"being late?"
msgstr ""

#. …ちゃんと来たんだから、
#. 校則違反にはならないはずよ？
msgctxt "0038 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I made it here just fine. What school regulation did I\n"
"violate?"
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、そうでしょう？
msgctxt "0039 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Am I wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. 姑息だね…霧切さんはホントに姑息だよ…
msgctxt "0040 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "You're so selfish... So spoiled!"
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、ペナルティーはないけどさ、
#. だけど、きっと後で後悔するはずだよ…
msgctxt "0041 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"You're right. There's no penalty, officially. But I\n"
"bet you'll be sorry later..."
msgstr ""

#. いや…後悔させてやるよ…
msgctxt "0042 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "No, I'll make *sure* you're sorry later...!"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、さっさとエレベーターに乗りやがれ。
#. ボクは一足先に行ってるからねッ！
msgctxt "0043 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Anyway, hustle your butts onto the elevator! I'll be\n"
"just one step ahead of ya!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…モノクマが去ったのと同時に、
#. ボクらは一斉に霧切さんの元に駆け寄った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>When Monokuma was gone, we all rushed up to Kyoko.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さん…！
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko...!"
msgstr ""

#. 死んでなかったんだね！？
msgctxt "0046 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "So you really didn't die!?"
msgstr ""

#. 当たり前じゃない…
msgctxt "0047 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Of course I didn't die..."
msgstr ""

#. よかった～！　生きてて良かった～！
msgctxt "0048 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Thank God! I'm so glad you're okay!"
msgstr ""

#. …生きていたからと言って、
#. 俺達にとって喜ばしい事態とも言い切れんがな…
msgctxt "0049 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Perhaps, but that's not necessarily a good thing for\n"
"us."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. そうだべ…そいつは幽霊なんだべ…！
msgctxt "0051 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "He's right! Now we've gotta deal with a gh-gh-ghost!"
msgstr ""

#. だから…あんたは黙ってなさいって…
msgctxt "0052 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "I told you, stop t-talking...!"
msgstr ""

#. …さっさと行くぞ。
#. 続きは学級裁判で話せばいい事だ。
msgctxt "0053 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Come on, let's just go. Whatever we need to discuss,\n"
"we can do it during the trial."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンは、霧切さんと１度も目を合わせる事なく、
#. エレベーターへと乗り込んでいった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Without ever looking directly at Kyoko, Byakuya\n"
"stepped into the elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 白夜様…ま、待ってください…！
msgctxt "0055 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Master! W-Wait for meee...!"
msgstr ""

#. そうだな…急がねーと、
#. 俺らも何されるかわかんねーし…
msgctxt "0056 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"Good call. Who knows what might happen to us if we\n"
"take too long...?"
msgstr ""

#. 喜ぶのは…
#. この学級裁判を乗り切ってからだよね…
msgctxt "0057 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I'll be happy when this trial is all over..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、みんなも続々と
#. エレベーターに乗り込んでいく。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>One after another, everyone piled into the elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、ボクには…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学級裁判の前に、どうしても
#. 霧切さんに確認しておきたい事があったんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I couldn't help myself. I had to talk to Kyoko before\n"
"the trial started.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さん、学級裁判の前に、
#. １つだけ聞かせて欲しいんだ…
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Listen, before we get started, I have to ask you..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0062 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. 今までどこに行ってたの？
msgctxt "0063 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Where have you been this whole time?"
msgstr ""

#. 例の鍵を使って、どこかに行ってたんでしょ？
#. それって…
msgctxt "0064 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You used that key of yours to go somewhere, didn't\n"
"you? So..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>寄宿舎の２階<CLT>よ。そこで調べ物をね…
msgctxt "0065 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I went to investigate <CLT 3>the 2nd floor of the dorms<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. 寄宿舎の…２階…？
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The...2nd floor?"
msgstr ""

#. あそこにはモニターも監視カメラもなかったわ。
#. お陰で、モノクマには気付かれずに済んだけど…
msgctxt "0067 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"There aren't any monitors or cameras there, so I was\n"
"able to avoid Monokuma completely."
msgstr ""

#. でも、そのせいで、
#. 私もモノクマアナウンスに気付く事が出来なかった…
msgctxt "0068 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Of course, I also missed his announcement because of\n"
"that."
msgstr ""

#. お陰で、こっちで死体が発見されてたなんて、
#. まったく知らなかったわ…
msgctxt "0069 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I had no idea a body had been discovered."
msgstr ""

#. 知ったのは…いつ？
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then...when did you find out?"
msgstr ""

#. さっき、調べ物を終えて１階に戻った直後…
#. そこで学級裁判が始まるってアナウンスを聞いたのよ…
msgctxt "0071 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Just now. I finished my search and came back down,\n"
"just in time to hear the class trial announcement."
msgstr ""

#. そこから、急いで現場を見て回ったわ。
#. 何も知らないまま学級裁判を迎えられないでしょう？
msgctxt "0072 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I took some time to go over the crime scene first. I\n"
"can't go to a trial completely uninformed, can I?"
msgstr ""

#. そのせいで…遅れて来たんだね…
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So that's why you were late..."
msgstr ""

#. 待たせて悪かったわね…
msgctxt "0074 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "I'm sorry I kept you all waiting."
msgstr ""

#. だけど、霧切さんが
#. 寄宿舎の２階に行ってたって事はさ…
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...if you were on the 2nd floor of the dorms..."
msgstr ""

#. あの鍵は、寄宿舎の２階の鍵だったって事？
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...then that's what the key you found goes to?"
msgstr ""

#. 正確に言えば違う…
#. あれは…
msgctxt "0077 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Actually, to be precise...not quite."
msgstr ""

#. …学園中のすべての鍵を解錠出来る
#. <CLT 3>“モノクマの秘密道具”<CLT>といったところかしら…
msgctxt "0078 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I used <CLT 3>Monokuma's secret tool<CLT>, which can open any\n"
"lock in the school."
msgstr ""

#. は…！？
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...!?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>霧切響子の証言<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Kyoko's Account<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ちょっと、２人して何してんの！？
#. 早くしないとモノクマに怒られちゃうよ！？
msgctxt "0081 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Hey! What are you two doing!? Hurry up, before we get\n"
"in trouble with Monokuma!"
msgstr ""

#. …苗木君、詳しい話は
#. この学級裁判を乗り切った後にしましょう…
msgctxt "0082 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"We can go over all the details after we get through\n"
"the trial, okay Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. 今は、この局面を乗り切る事に、
#. 集中したいの。
msgctxt "0083 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Right now I just want to focus on surviving our\n"
"current situation."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、ここが…
#. 私にとっての最大の正念場だから…
msgctxt "0084 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Because this is probably the single most crucial\n"
"moment so far for me."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…私にとっての？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>For...her?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それって、なんだか妙な物言いだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's a strange way to put it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この学級裁判が、みんなにとっての難関というより、
#. “自分にとってだけの難関”みたいな口ぶりで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The class trial is important for everyone, right? So\n"
"why would she say it's a crucial moment for *her*?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…先に行ってるわよ…
msgctxt "0088 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Well, if that's all..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクの心配もよそに、
#. 霧切さんはエレベーターへと向かって歩き出した。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0089 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Seemingly unconcerned, Kyoko made her way to the\n"
"elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>考え過ぎ……だよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm just...overthinking what she said, right...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>エレベーターに乗る前に、
#. 霧切さんに話を聞かないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I really need to talk to Kyoko before I get on the\n"
"elevator...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、最後になったボクが、
#. エレベーターに乗り込んだところで…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0092 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Being the last one left, I stepped into the elevator.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ドアが閉じた。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>And the doors slid shut...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ゴウン、ゴウンと響く耳障りな音に、
#. 不安と恐怖が膨らんでいく…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0094 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This time, the clunking was loud enough to hurt my\n"
"ears, and the dread began to consume me once again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この死刑執行を待つような強烈なプレッシャーだけは、
#. 本当に慣れる事がない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0095 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't imagine ever getting used to the mental\n"
"pressure that comes with preparing for an execution.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>薄暗い闇の中、誰も口を開かない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0096 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In that dusky darkness, nobody said a word.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ただ、じっと黙っているだけ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0097 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>We just stood there, silent and still.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そして、しばらくしたところで、
#. 途端に視界が開かれる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After an immeasurable period of time, the doors opened\n"
"without warning...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まばゆい光がボクの目の奥を刺激する…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0099 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A dazzling light penetrated every depth of my eyes.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、それは希望の光なんかじゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But it wasn't the illuminating light of hope...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それは絶望の光……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It was the blinding light of despair.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんに話を聞かないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I need to talk to Kyoko...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう逃げられないんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0103 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's no running away now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
